      "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature within 60 feet of you is about to meet the trigger for Queen’s Grace or Patron of Kings</p><hr><p><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">You impart the power and knowledge of a storied ruler in an instant to a creature, granting them a boon. The target creature gains the benefits of Queen’s Grace or Patron of Kings for the triggering action or reaction. You can only use the feats you have learned, and this counts as a usage of Queen’s Grace or Patron of Kings for the day.</span></p>"
